{"id":"n15806-1-11","stage":3,"title":"바람직하다 · 妥当","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15806-1-11-1","ko":"저는 일주일에 세 번씩 자전거를 타고 있어요.","zh":"我每周骑三次自行车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"일주일에","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일에","audio":"/audio/4440ea99afeec77fc6c6.mp3"}},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三。","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"번씩","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번씩","audio":"/audio/4ab12440d8f3b33bd558.mp3"}},{"text":"자전거를","meaning":"自行车","explanation":"자전거：自行车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자전거","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62517","senseId":"1","lemma":"자전거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자전거를","audio":"/audio/9a4a3197c77572031111.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"骑，坐","explanation":"타다：骑，坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"4","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"91e88e6f412fe193","term":"자전거","zh":"自行车","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3","entryId":"62517","definition":"人的座驾，用两只脚踩使轮胎转动前进。","pronunciation":["자전거"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"骑，坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"跨坐在人或物体上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c12c921a26571462698.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15806-1-11-2","ko":"그렇게 규칙적으로 운동하는 건 아주 바람직해요.","zh":"能如此规律地锻炼真是非常值得提倡的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","